  "lesson": {
    "title": "What Changes a Pendulum's Swing?",
    "description": "Adjust the rod length, bob mass, and release angle of a swinging pendulum. Watch the motion and angle graph to see which changes alter the swing period.",
    "instructions": "Use the sliders to change length, mass, and release angle. Scrub or pause time to compare the swing period and maximum speed.",
    "goal": "Discover that only length changes a pendulum's period, while mass and small release angles leave the period unchanged."
